BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Photo Editing with Photoshop (Advanced)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260921T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260921T190000
UID:6a8c9ef1be1482002989b4a6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Adobe Photoshop is the world’s best imaging and graphic desi
 gn software and is at the core of just about every creative project\, from
  photo editing and compositing to digital painting\, animation\, and graph
 ic design.\nThis is an advanced class. Basic computer and photo editing s
 kills required. Attendants must have an account to sign into Adobe Photosh
 op. It could be a google account\, apple account\, Facebook account\, Inst
 agram account or an account created by signing in to adobe.com.\nThis is a
 n in-person event\, registration required via Eventbrite two weeks before.
  For safety reason\, no child under 6 years old allowed in this program. E
 ach child 6-12 years old should accompany with an adult.\nPlease be noted 
 that your spot will be taken by others if you failed to show up 5 mins aft
 er class begins.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information
  on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public 
 Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will o
 nly be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. 
 Questions about how the library handles your information can be directed t
 o Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Stre
 et\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Fairview\, 3rd Floor\, Digital Innovation Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a8c9ef1be1482002989b4a6
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
