SUMMARY:St. Lawrence Branch Relocation and Expansion – Virtual Informati
 on Session
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260917T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260917T200000
UID:6a8c64ecd4b10d003008adbc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Public Library is planning to relocate and expand the 
 St. Lawrence Branch to 339 Queen Street East. The new location will be a d
 istrict branch with more space\, expanded services\, and a broader range o
 f programs and collections for the community.\nFrom April to August 2026\,
  we connected with the community through consultation sessions\, focus gro
 ups\, and community events focused on library spaces\, collections\, progr
 ams\, and services for all ages.\nJoin us to:\nGet an update on the projec
 t\nExplore the early design plans for 339 Queen Street East\nLearn how com
 munity feedback has helped shape the plans\nAsk questions and share your f
 eedback about the designs at 339 Queen Street East during the Q&A\nRegistr
 ation is required for the virtual Zoom event. Once you register\, you’ll
  receive an email with the Zoom link before the event.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a8c64ecd4b10d003008adbc
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
