 r Improvisational Writing Club hosted by our artists-in-residency Spy Coll
 ective (Akash Bansal and Margot Fabre). These experimental writing session
 s will blend structured written exercises with movement\, collage and more
 \, in order to help explore your creative potential.\nIn these sessions yo
 u can expect to learn unconventional techniques for writing stories and po
 ems\, as well as collaborative ways to write and make art. This program is
  designed to be approachable by teens of all experience levels: whether yo
 u have been writing for a long time or always wanted to try it.\nWorkshops
  will be delivered in English\, but ESL participants are welcome to join. 
 All supplies will be provided.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service.
  Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer
 \, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are
