 ldren under 12 must be accompanied by a parent/caregiver. Registration is 
 required.\nPresented as part of TPL’s environmental program series\, Our
  Fragile Planet. The series is generously supported by Friends of Toronto 
 Public Library\, South Chapter.\nThe tour will start and end at the Steele
 s\nBranch side entrance\nand will be guided by the City of Toronto Urban F
 orestry staff. There may be uneven\, unpaved surfaces along the route. Ple
 ase dress and prepare accordingly for this outdoor program (e.g. gloves/mi
 ttens\, hats\, sunscreen\, water\, comfortable shoes). This program takes 
 place rain or shine. In the event of severe inclement weather\, registrant
 s will be notified of an alternative date.
