DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260926T120000
UID:6a84d1a6bf1aec09082b8041@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Want to learn to sew or would like a refresher on how to use a
  sewing machine? Our intro to sewing course will cover the basics of threa
 ding the machine\, basic stitches and more. We will be creating a small po
 uch. All materials will be provided.\nChildren under 13 must be accompanie
 d by an adult.\nRegistration is required for this class and begins Septemb
 er 12th\, 2026 at 12:30 pm.\nNote: Your spot will not be guaranteed after 
 5 minutes of the start of the program.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nTh
 e personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Lib
 rary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). 
 The information will only be used for event and program registration\, del
