 g techniques will be demonstrated.  The techniques include using transit
 ions and titles\, adding audio and a soundtrack\, cutting and splicing\, a
 nd using the timeline.\nApple laptops with iMovie installed will be provid
 ed for the class.\nRegistration is required.\nInformation Collection Notic
 e:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Publ
 ic Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 2
