 cornrows\, twists\, knotless braids\, and more. The program will include a
  presentation on the history of hair braiding and the importance of hair c
 are\, followed by examples of different styles and hands-on demonstrations
  and practice using mannequin heads.\nAge: 13-17\nAll materials such as co
 mbs\, hair extensions\, and mannequin heads will be provided.\nRegistratio
 n required
