DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261010T130000
UID:6a81ea51452bb101b5758f63@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program helps people stay active\, make friends\, learn n
 ew skills\, and have fun. Meet new folks\, build connections\, and tell us
  about programs and services you would like to see in the neighbourhood!\n
 Come join us every Saturday for screenings of your favourite movies. In ad
 dition to this\, enjoy cuddles with a therapy dog! Therapy dog Goose visi
 ts Fort York Branch on alternate Saturdays from 11:00AM-12:00PM.\nWe'll b
 e showing the following films:\nAug 22 - Beauty& The Beast(1991)\nAug 29 
 - Jumanji\nSept 5 - 101 Dalmatians (1961)\nSept 12 - Beverly Hills Chih
 uahua\nSept 19 - A Bug's Life\nSept 26 - The Boss Baby\nOct 3 - The Shag
 gy Dog (1959)\nOct 17 - Toy Story 5\nOct 24 - The Absent Minded Professor 
 (1961)\nOct 31 - Hotel Transylvania\nNov 7 - Herbie the Love Bug (1968)\n
 Nov 14 - Africa-An Cats\nNov 21 - The Odd Life of Timothy Green\nNov 28 -
  Little Big League\nDrop-ins are welcome.\nThis program is in collaborati
 on with\nGerstein Crisis Centre's F.R.E.S.H. initiative\n.
LOCATION:Fort York\, Urban Living Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a81ea51452bb101b5758f63
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
