UID:69e25ef5fca21471b7ef7d58@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Next we will be inspired by the library’s architecture and h
 appenings as we are guided by musician Aniqa Qadir to create a soundscape.
  Working in groups\, visitors will be prompted to absorb the sounds of the
  building and led through the process of creating an audio journey. This p
 layful session welcomes participants to break the whisper norm of a librar
 y and interrupt the space with their observations.\nLed by Aniqa Qadir and
  Ursula Handleigh
