 \nseries. A film project partnership between the ONTARIO FEDERATION OF IN
 DIGENOUS FRIENDSHIP CENTRES and THE NATIONAL FILM BOARD OF CANADA.\nThere 
 are no ratings for the listed featured documentaries:\nHonour to Senator 
 Murray Sinclair\n(2021) - 29 min\nSome Stories\n(\n2018)\n- 8 min\nZaagi
 'idiwin\n(2018) - 9 min\nPlaces to Gather and Learn\n(2018) - 10 min\nFull
  Circle\n(2018) - 8 min\nDrop-in. No registration required. All are welco
 me.
