DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Youth Hub for some tie-dying! We'll provide th
 e t-shirts\, you provide the creativity! Participants will take home thei
 r freshly tie-dyed creations on the same day\; be prepared to wash your c
 reations once you arrive home so that your project comes out its best. We 
 also recommend wearing old clothes so that you don't get any dyes on your 
 favourite outfit!\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs a
 re a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where help
 ful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered dail
 y. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out mor
